## MCP vs plain `split("")`

| Approach | Good for |
|----------|----------|
| `split("").reverse().join("")` | ASCII / simple BMP text (what coding MCP showed first) |
| `Array.from(s).reverse().join("")` | Emoji and supplementary Unicode (coding MCP’s second recommendation) |

For new code, prefer **`Array.from`** (or `[...input]`) unless you know the input is ASCII-only.

